<title>UK: London palladium fixes at fresh eight-year high.</title>
<headline>London palladium fixes at fresh eight-year high.</headline>
<text>
<p>PALLADIUM - Fixed at $180.50 up $0.75 from Tuesday afternoon and setting fresh high since the $181.50 on April 14, 1989. Very tight, Russsian shipment plans seen irrelevant in tight market.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Fixed at $396.00 fresh high since February 28, 1997. Also tight and unfazed by Russian export news.</p>
<p>GOLD - Unchanged at $342.50/$343.00.</p>
<p>SILVER - Down two cents at $4.68/$4.70,</p>
